add('documents','Before you arrive','Prepare the documents your route needs','Request the authority’s current checklist for passports, photos, qualifications, company papers or family certificates. Confirm attestation and translation requirements for each document; not every foreign-issued document follows the same process.',[['MOFA attestation services',sources.mofa],['ICP',sources.icp]]);
add('flight','Before you arrive','Arrange your flight and airport transfer','Include Etihad when comparing flights to Abu Dhabi. Check entry requirements, baggage, flexible fares and cancellation terms. Keep your temporary accommodation address and arrival documents handy; arrange a licensed airport transfer.',[['Etihad','https://www.etihad.com/'],['Abu Dhabi Taxi',sources.taxi]]);
