add('medical','Your first days','Coordinate residence, medical and Emirates ID','Follow your sponsor or authority’s sequence. Residence applicants aged 18 and over generally need medical fitness screening. Use an approved centre, complete required Emirates ID application/biometrics and track residence processing. Timelines depend on the route and appointments.',[['Residence requirements',sources.residence],['ICP',sources.icp],['TAMM',sources.tamm]]);
add('health','Your first days',family?'Arrange health cover for each family member':'Arrange your health insurance','Check Abu Dhabi health insurance requirements and who must arrange and pay for coverage. Compare networks, exclusions, waiting periods and pre-existing-condition cover. Residence medical screening is separate from insurance; include dependants and elderly parents in the insurance discussion.',[['Department of Health Abu Dhabi',sources.health],['Abu Dhabi Residents Office',sources.residents]]);
add('identity','Your first days','Connect your phone and government services','Arrange a SIM with a licensed provider, checking the identification requirements. Set up UAE PASS where eligible and use TAMM and ICP for the services relevant to your route. Some services require their own apps even though this planner works in the browser.',[['TAMM',sources.tamm],['ICP',sources.icp],['e& UAE','https://www.etisalat.ae/'],['du','https://www.du.ae/']]);
